OL,3,GNEWSANew bridges installed at park in
OL,4,Aaccess upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new bridges have been installed at
OL,7,Fa park in Derbyshire as part of a
OL,8,Fproject aiming to improve access for
OL,9,Fpedestrians and cyclists.
OL,11,FPlaced over the River Wye in Ashwood
OL,12,FPark, Buxton, the new structures
OL,13,Freplace old bridges, including one
OL,14,Fwhich needed widening, said the Buxton
OL,15,FTown Team community group.
OL,17,FIt added that a third bridge, which had
OL,18,Fbeen closed for safety reasons for more
OL,19,Fthan 20 years after a neighbouring tree
OL,20,Fcollapsed, was also installed at the
OL,21,Fpark during the summer.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
